  "texto": "# Getting ready\n@energy 2\n> A soft voice, like someone preparing something with care.\n\n[slow][soft]Imagine it's a cold afternoon and you're at home.\nOutside, rain falls gently and the sky is gray.\n[breathe]\nIn your hands you hold a cup of hot chocolate.\nFeel its weight and its warmth in your palms.\nCan you notice it climbing into your fingers, little by little? [up]\n[breathe]\nLet your shoulders drop and your back lean against the chair.\nThere's no hurry: this afternoon is just for you.\nYou don't have to go anywhere.[/soft][/slow]\n[pause 3s]\n\n# The aroma\n@energy 1\n> Very slow, leaving space between each image.\n\n[soft]Bring the cup close to your face, without drinking yet.\nBreathe in its aroma: cocoa, a hint of cinnamon and some vanilla.\n[breathe]\nThe steam rises and warms your nose and cheeks.\nClose your eyes and stay with that smell for a moment.\nIt's an ancient aroma that traveled from the rainforest to your kitchen.\n[breathe]\nThink of the hands that grew the cacao under the trees.\nOf the sun, the rain and the soil that made it grow.\nAll of that now fits in your cup.[/soft]\n[pause 3s]\n\n# The first sip\n@energy 1\n> Almost a whisper, savoring each word.\n\n[slow][soft]Now take a small sip, very slowly.\nLet the chocolate rest in your mouth before you swallow.\nTaste the sweet, the bitter and the creamy, all at once.\n[breathe]\nNotice how the warmth moves down your chest and stays there.\nIt's a quiet warmth, like a hug from the inside.\nIt's a simple pleasure, and it's yours.\n[breathe]\nIf your mind wanders somewhere else, that's okay.\nGently return to the taste in your cup.\nThis moment doesn't need anything more.[/soft][/slow]\n[pause 3s]\n\n# The rain\n@energy 2\n> Soft and steady, like the rain you describe.\n\n[soft]Listen again to the rain on the roof.\nEach drop is a small rhythm, always a little different.\nThe window looks like a painting in shades of gray.\n[breathe]\nBreathe with the rain: in, hold, and out.\nLet the sound wash away the thoughts of the day.\nWhatever worried you can wait outside, like the cold.\n[breathe]\nIn here, everything is warm, slow and **safe**.\nWhen did you last give yourself a pause like this? [up]\nEnjoy it without guilt.[/soft]\n[pause 3s]\n\n# Returning\n@energy 2\n> Come back with calm; a warm tone at the end.\n\n[slow]Finish your cup with one last sip, without hurrying.\nSet it down on a plate and rest your warm hands on your legs.[/slow]\n[breathe]\nTake one more deep breath and notice your whole body.\nMove your fingers, stretch your neck a little and open your eyes.\n[breathe]\nThe day is still there, but you return with a different calm.\nYou can repeat this ritual whenever you need it.\nA cup, an aroma and a few minutes just for you. [down]\nThank you for giving yourself this moment.\n[pause 3s]\n"
